{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong>A New Perspective on Chess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ChessFinity is a sandbox strategy game built on the foundation of chess\u2014but designed to be reshaped.\u00a0Whether you're here to tweak a single rule, build the board from scratch, or invite nine friends into the mix, the goal is always the same: <strong>explore what happens when you break away from tradition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play it straight. Or you can play something no one\u2019s ever played before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/deployment_1.gif?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/changing_views.gif?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mana Chess : Deckbuilding Hybrid</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Draw chess pieces from a deck. Spend mana to place them. Play feels familiar\u2014but full of surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This mode combines tactical positioning with card-game unpredictability and build strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/screen_new_12.png?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/spriggan_taking_piece.gif?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Features at Launch:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Classic &amp; Classic+</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with the standard 8x8, or try built-in variants like Fischer Random (Chess960). Whether you're training tactics or trying something offbeat, core chess remains central.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f<strong>\u00a0Chess Gameplay with Support for 3+ Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo, with a friend, or with 10 people in a wild multiplayer free-for-all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try team games, tag-in modes, or play asynchronously at your own pace. Every mode supports multiple play styles<br>Experience chess across multiple layers with verticality in gameplay. Play in classic 1v1 duels, team-based matches, or even larger free-for-all games in local or online multiplayer. ChessFinity gives you new dimensions\u2014literally and figuratively\u2014to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Chess and Variants</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chess has many , many variants and they can all now be played in 3d with more players and different win conditions. Enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Modifiable Boards and Rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/Screenshot_2024-12-05_at_14.39.18.png?t=1744646159\" />ChessFinity allows you to modify key elements of the game. Adjust board dimensions, toggle what you want on , drag your slider , lock in a test. Happy modding guys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asynchronous Play for All Modes</strong><br>Time is the 4th dimension after all. We offer all modes to be played in the way you want - if we do it... Who knows , maybe it could catch on to other CCG's?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/Screenshot_2025-01-26_at_22.18.12.png?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Future Updates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ChessFinity is a constantly evolving platform. But - you can look forward to a roguelike campaign and UGC tooling for puzzles, cards and pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/Screenshot_2025-01-23_at_08.40.49.png?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Always Chess just different...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ChessFinity is designed to broaden how chess can be played. Whether you prefer the standard game or want to explore new mechanics, ChessFinity offers endless replayability for both casual players and dedicated strategists. Wishlist today and join our Discord community to stay updated on upcoming features, tournaments, and more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3268290?t=1744646159","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3268290?t=1744646159","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/a15db2e59bc27e61193978275a7151f199727749/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744646159","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/a15db2e59bc27e61193978275a7151f199727749/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744646159","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3463010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong>A New Perspective on Chess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ChessFinity is a sandbox strategy game built on the foundation of chess\u2014but designed to be reshaped.\u00a0Whether you're here to tweak a single rule, build the board from scratch, or invite nine friends into the mix, the goal is always the same: <strong>explore what happens when you break away from tradition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play it straight. Or you can play something no one\u2019s ever played before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/deployment_1.gif?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/changing_views.gif?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mana Chess : Deckbuilding Hybrid</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Draw chess pieces from a deck. Spend mana to place them. Play feels familiar\u2014but full of surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This mode combines tactical positioning with card-game unpredictability and build strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/screen_new_12.png?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/spriggan_taking_piece.gif?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Features at Launch:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Classic &amp; Classic+</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with the standard 8x8, or try built-in variants like Fischer Random (Chess960). Whether you're training tactics or trying something offbeat, core chess remains central.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f<strong>\u00a0Chess Gameplay with Support for 3+ Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo, with a friend, or with 10 people in a wild multiplayer free-for-all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try team games, tag-in modes, or play asynchronously at your own pace. Every mode supports multiple play styles<br>Experience chess across multiple layers with verticality in gameplay. Play in classic 1v1 duels, team-based matches, or even larger free-for-all games in local or online multiplayer. ChessFinity gives you new dimensions\u2014literally and figuratively\u2014to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> Chess and Variants</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chess has many , many variants and they can all now be played in 3d with more players and different win conditions. Enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Modifiable Boards and Rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/Screenshot_2024-12-05_at_14.39.18.png?t=1744646159\" />ChessFinity allows you to modify key elements of the game. Adjust board dimensions, toggle what you want on , drag your slider , lock in a test. Happy modding guys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asynchronous Play for All Modes</strong><br>Time is the 4th dimension after all. We offer all modes to be played in the way you want - if we do it... Who knows , maybe it could catch on to other CCG's?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/Screenshot_2025-01-26_at_22.18.12.png?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Future Updates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ChessFinity is a constantly evolving platform. But - you can look forward to a roguelike campaign and UGC tooling for puzzles, cards and pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/extras/Screenshot_2025-01-23_at_08.40.49.png?t=1744646159\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Always Chess just different...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ChessFinity is designed to broaden how chess can be played. Whether you prefer the standard game or want to explore new mechanics, ChessFinity offers endless replayability for both casual players and dedicated strategists. Wishlist today and join our Discord community to stay updated on upcoming features, tournaments, and more.</p>","developers":["Chessfinity"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268290/5c951dbe6cef37494f68e1fc2cc78aeba2116872/header.jpg?t=1744646159","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.14 (Mojave) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel @ 2 GHz or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Graphics or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.14 (Mojave) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 @ 2.6 GHz or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon Pro 560, Nvidia GeForce GTX 750M, or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB a